<title>MEXICO: Mexico Jan-Feb heavy vehicle sales surge - industry.</title>
<headline>Mexico Jan-Feb heavy vehicle sales surge - industry.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heavy vehicle sales in Mexico for January and February were up sharply from the year-ago period, an industry statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The National Association of Motor Coaches and Trucks posted sales of 1,774 units in January and February, an increase of 118.20 percent from the same period last year, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Veronica Galan, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9553</p>
